<div x-data="codeMatch" x-init="boot()"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/modules">Modules</a><span>/</span><span>Python Turtle Basics</span><span>/</span><span>Practice</span></div>
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PAHAMI KODE, KENALI GERAKAN</span><h1>Temukan pasangan yang tepat.</h1><p>Hubungkan setiap deskripsi gerakan dengan kode Python yang sesuai.</p></div><div class="match-stats"><div><small>SCORE</small><b x-text="matched.length*25">0</b></div><div><small>ACCURACY</small><b x-text="accuracy+'%'">0%</b></div><button class="secondary" @click="reset()">↻ Reset</button></div></div>
<div class="match-instructions"><span class="step-circle">1</span><span>Pilih deskripsi gerakan</span><span class="muted">→</span><span class="step-circle">2</span><span>Pilih kode yang sesuai</span><span class="match-count" x-text="matched.length+' / 4 pasangan cocok'"></span></div>
<div class="match-grid"><section><div class="column-heading"><span>DESKRIPSI GERAKAN</span><span>A — D</span></div><div class="match-column"><template x-for="pair in pairs" :key="pair.id"><button class="match-card" :class="{'selected':selected===pair.id,'matched':matched.includes(pair.id),'wrong':wrongId===pair.id}" :disabled="matched.includes(pair.id)" :aria-pressed="selected===pair.id" @click="selected=pair.id"><span class="pair-letter" x-text="matched.includes(pair.id)?'✓':pair.id.toUpperCase()"></span><span><b x-text="pair.title"></b><span class="match-desc" x-text="pair.description"></span><small x-show="matched.includes(pair.id)">Pasangan benar</small></span></button></template></div></section>
<section><div class="column-heading"><span>KODE PYTHON</span><span>01 — 04</span></div><div class="match-column"><template x-for="(pair,i) in snippets" :key="pair.id"><button class="match-card snippet" :class="{'matched':matched.includes(pair.id),'wrong':wrongSnippet===pair.id}" :disabled="matched.includes(pair.id)" @click="choose(pair.id)"><span class="pair-letter" x-text="matched.includes(pair.id)?'✓':String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')"></span><pre x-text="pair.code"></pre><span class="sr-only" x-show="matched.includes(pair.id)">Pasangan benar</span></button></template></div></section></div>
<div class="match-feedback" :class="matched.length===4?'success':''" role="status"><b x-text="feedback"></b><span x-text="saveStatus"></span><a href="/maze" class="text-link" x-show="matched.length===4">Coba di Maze Quest →</a></div>
